    "updated_at": "2024-10-28T03:54:20Z",
    "body": "This is just a proposed change to conformance requirements, as I understand it, so I'll re-tag a bit.\r\n\r\nOne possible consideration here is accessibility. E.g., we may want to require that `<li>` elements are children of custom elements whose default ARIA role semantics (as set by `elementInternals.role`) are `list`.",
